  "description": "\"I really like the Super Acciaio. It ticks a huge number of boxes...\" Feb 2020 - Cyclist MagazineOur thoroughbred, race-ready steel frameset has continuously evolved since it was developed with pro riders from Rapha Condor in 2012. The first UCI approved steel bike to appear on the pro scene since the nineties, the Super Acciaio can hold its own in crits and on climbs, thanks to an exquisite selection of custom-formed Columbus Spirit HSS tubes and monocoque carbon fork. When you step on the pedals, get ready to spring up to speed and drop your rivals.Custom tuned ColumbusBuilt using Columbus triple-butted steel, we have tuned the profiles of the tubes to create the perfect ride that is sharp, responsive, and comfortable. Condor Smart CablingOur Smart Cabling system allows you to choose any groupset and if you want to change to Di2/EPS, mechanical or eTap AXS in the future you don't need to worry about messy cabling or compatability or additional frame holes, which compromise tube strength.Learn more about Smart Cabling.Thru-axleThru-axles not only keep the disc running straight, but also improve the stiffness of the frame. Paired with our tapered carbon race fork, the Super Acciaio delivers fast reaction to steering input. Learn more about Thru Axles.",
